  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3229.06 Handlebars or Grips. Pursuant to RSA 266:77, the handlebars or grips of each motorcycle shall be no higher than the shoulder level of the driver when in the seat or saddle.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by 11016, eff 1-6-16",
